- **Design APIs to Facilitate Data Management:** Establish clear data entry and retrieval points within your application, especially relating to storing user feedback and accessing existing tips. Implement necessary loading and saving mechanisms.

- **Incorporate User Session Management:** Plan for user session management, including functionalities for logging in and out. Review state handling thoroughly to avoid issues when designs change or features develop.

By adhering to these points during the development process, future implementations can avoid previous pitfalls and enhance the overall user experience. 

